format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9762207b67f5d9fda8cef3ed24e0cb7d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2fb5090a/uploads/origins/8c12e9a8-589f-46bd-9fb6-5821d408f7bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9762207b67f5d9fda8cef3ed24e0cb7d, https://si.imgix.net/2fb5090a/uploads/origins/8c12e9a8-589f-46bd-9fb6-5821d408f7bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=233d44ca3544d515fd6753866d0d5690 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2fb5090a/uploads/origins/8c12e9a8-589f-46bd-9fb6-5821d408f7bd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0fa1366deb8812d040209dbae1ba46fa 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you, Mr. Mejiro Pistachio.\n\nI would like to draw a story in which Koyanskaya, the light (or dark if possible), proposes a travel plan for the battered Tachika Fujimaru (penis) to go to a singularity or the realm of Koyanskaya's body where she can live peacefully all the time until she dies of old age? I asked her to draw a story in which she proposes a travel plan for the two of them to go to the realm of the singularity or the realm of Koyanskaya's body, where Fujimaru Tachika (male), who is in a state of raggedness, can live peacefully until he dies of old age.\n\nThis story is an adaptation of a scene from an SS I wrote in the past (this work is R-18, but the requested scene itself has no R-18 elements. I apologize if you find it offensive. (The scene itself is not R-18, but I am sorry if you find it offensive.)\nI really wanted to see this scene with your picture.\n\n\nThe flow of the scene is as follows\n\nKoyanskaya negotiating with the master to sign a contract and run away with him.\n\nThe Master refuses, saying he cannot sign now because he still has things to do.\n\nKoyanskaya says \"I don't want to see you suffer any more\" with a serious and pained expression on her face.\n[This panel reveals that the master is a wreck (in an easily recognizable way, for example, with a bandage over his right eye).\n\nI'm lost for a moment, but...\nI don't want to default on the contract I made with you in Tunguska.\nWhen it's all over, we'll go on a space trip together.\"\nMaster proposes and rejects proposals such as\n\nKoyanskaya, with a light tear in her eye and a smile on her face, affirms the proposal and says that she will prepare an exquisite travel plan for him.\n\n\nI would like to ask you to do something like this.\n\nIf there is a scene that is troublesome to express in the above way, you can change it.\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/novel/show.php?id=21962843", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ej_pistachio/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1981844, "client_id": 1259436, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/38d37ec5/uploads/origins/ed7563ca-af59-4122-8df1-a462b8de6440?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14f3899bcd97280b04294ea218edbc44", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/38d37ec5/uploads/origins/ed7563ca-af59-4122-8df1-a462b8de6440?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14f3899bcd97280b04294ea218edbc44, https://si.imgix.net/38d37ec5/uploads/origins/ed7563ca-af59-4122-8df1-a462b8de6440?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa33dd2705d1d934e05cbae6f68e4b1d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/38d37ec5/uploads/origins/ed7563ca-af59-4122-8df1-a462b8de6440?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=296404e66affc02cf81c2c69d12dd39c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/38d37ec5/uploads/origins/ed7563ca-af59-4122-8df1-a462b8de6440?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&